OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo forces further
OL,4,AMerseyside closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore attractions and events across
OL,7,FMerseyside are continuing to announce
OL,8,Fclosures due to Storm Boelo, which is
OL,9,Fdue to hit the region.
OL,11,FA yellow weather warning is in place
OL,12,Facross Merseyside and is expected to
OL,13,Fremain until 23:00 BST on Sunday 25
OL,14,FOctober.
OL,16,FLiverpool City Council has now
OL,17,Fconfirmed Saturday's River of Light
OL,18,Fevent is cancelled. It is the second
OL,19,Fnight in a row the event will not have
OL,20,Ftaken place due to safety.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
